  noise:['学生 / 陈玉英 / 阿丽','我们住在同一栋楼，却还不了解彼此的休息时间。','We share one block, but do not yet understand each other’s rest times.','持续冲突会影响邻里关系与租户的居住稳定。','Ongoing conflict affects community ties and tenants’ stability.'],
  housing:['拉赫曼与努尔','孩子搬出去了，我们想知道换房接下来能找谁帮忙。','Our children have moved out. Who can help us with the next housing step?','一直没有进展，会影响换房屋主的状态与信任。','A lack of progress can affect owners looking to move and their trust.'],
